  "description": "Gold - Hood - Dell - Palantir - Shopify - Affirm - Apple - SOFI - PAAS - And overall market discussion 17 April 2025",
  "body_html": "<p>If you have a drive to work or doing a chore around the house, this is a good video to put on for background listening. </p><p>This was an overall market discussion where we break down the VIX, SPY, Gold and do several ticker reviews. We also talk about how stocks are breaching pivot points, but not holding. </p><p>As always, if you have questions, feel free to ping me in the chat. Thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p>",
